#!grafli v1
# Street Network 101 — concept overview
# Companion board to paper.md; how a drawn line becomes traffic.

# ── entry / meta ──
@ box paper "Paper →︎\nthe full derivation" 60,60 230x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ box viewState "viewState persistence\nthe drawn plan, the cars,\nthe clock and the watch set\nsurvive a reload exactly" 340,50 270x120 %plum &link:./paper.md#measured-results
@ box lang "language EN / DE\nLabLang dict + LangSwitch\nkit owns the vocabulary" 650,55 280x110 %forest
@ note legend 970,60 """
left →︎ right: draw →︎ derive →︎ drive
nothing in the middle column
is ever drawn by hand
""" ~small

# ── draw ──
@ box draw "you draw a road\nA CLICK SELECTS, A DRAG DRAWS\nfrom open ground, from a dead\nend, or off a road (→︎ a T)\nring = joins · cross = splits" 60,280 240x150 %teal &link:./paper.md#run-it
@ box planar "planar graph\njoins what it touches,\nSPLITS what it crosses\nnodes + straight roads" 60,470 240x140 %primary &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications

# ── derive (the subject) ──
@ box boxes "1 junction boxes\nd ≥ h / sin θ\ncollinear joint →︎ radius 0" 370,250 265x120 %clay &link:./paper.md#the-derivation
@ box lanes "2 lane centerlines\nr = u × ŷ, offset (k+½)·W\nright-hand traffic" 370,410 265x120 %clay &link:./paper.md#the-derivation
@ box turns "3 turn connectors\nbezier, control = where the\nlanes' own lines cross\nNO U-turns" 370,570 265x140 %clay &link:./paper.md#the-derivation
@ box deadend "dead end\na lane with no exits\n(not a special case —\njust an empty exit list)" 370,760 265x130 %accent &link:./paper.md#the-derivation

@ box conflicts "conflicts\ncurves that cross, or that\nfeed the same lane\n4-way →︎ 30 pairs\nleft 7 · straight 6 · right 2" 700,240 260x150 %highlight &link:./paper.md#right-of-way

@ box bans "turn restrictions\n(junction, from-road, to-road)\nDIRECTED: A→B ≠ B→A\nstill drawn, dashed + red\nsurvives every re-derive" 370,940 265x160 %plum &link:./paper.md#turn-restrictions

# ── drive ──
@ box follow "FOLLOW\ngap = 2.4 + 0.85·v\nlooks one element ahead" 700,430 260x110 %rose &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications
@ box yield "YIELD\nbooking held until through\nonly the car at the line\nrevalidated every step" 700,580 260x140 %rose &link:./paper.md#right-of-way
@ box leave "LEAVE\nfades over the last 14 u\nof a terminal lane" 700,760 260x110 %accent &link:./paper.md#the-derivation

@ box cars "cars\nspawn anywhere there is room\nuniform choice at junctions\nno routes, no destinations" 1020,430 275x140 %teal &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications

# ── readouts ──
@ box dual "lane graph (M)\nthe same model drawn as\nwhat it IS: one arrow per\nlane, rings at dead ends" 1020,250 275x140 %primary &link:./paper.md#measured-results
@ box monitor "monitor\nwatch roads (W)\nflow /min · load · speed\nShift+R records a run" 1020,620 275x130 %rose &link:./paper.md#run-it

# ── the three results ──
@ note shape 60,680 """
result 1 — shape decides lifetime
p = share of turns into a dead end
crossroads p=1.00 →︎  6.6 s
grid       p=0.33 →︎ 10.0 s
ring       p=0.13 →︎ 28.5 s
a car on the ring lives 4.3x longer
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#measured-results

@ note bansresult 700,940 """
result 3 — closing a turn can ADD capacity
demand 1.5, every interior 4-way:
open        thr 431 · 25% standing
no lefts    thr 492 · 15% standing
no rights   thr 345 · 33% standing
a left turn conflicts with 7 movements,
a right turn with 2 - so the ban that
frees a junction is the left one
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#closing-turns-changes-capacity-and-the-sign-is-not-obvious

@ note capacity 1020,800 """
result 2 — a network has a capacity
demand 1.5 →︎ asked 71, held 68
demand 2.5 →︎ asked 118, held 78
demand 3.0 →︎ asked 140, held 78
asking for more simply gives none
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#measured-results

# ── scenarios ──
@ note scen 60,880 """
scenarios (keys 1-4)
1 crossroads - one junction, four stubs
2 grid - 9 crossings, traffic recirculates
3 cul-de-sac - a tree; every branch ends
4 ring - a loop that keeps its cars
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#measured-results

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow draw -> planar "one gesture"
@ arrow planar -> boxes
@ arrow boxes -> lanes "trimmed span"
@ arrow lanes -> turns "in x out"
@ arrow turns -> deadend "none legal" !dashed
@ arrow turns -> conflicts "which two clash"
@ arrow lanes -> follow "the track"
@ arrow conflicts -> yield "may I go?"
@ arrow deadend -> leave
@ arrow follow -> cars
@ arrow yield -> cars
@ arrow leave -> cars
@ arrow lanes -> dual "same model"
@ arrow cars -> monitor "sampled"
@ arrow scen -> draw "build" !dashed
@ arrow viewState -> planar "restores the plan" !dashed
@ arrow cars -> capacity "spawn finds no gap" !dotted
@ arrow deadend -> shape "absorbs" !dotted
@ arrow bans -> turns "removes a movement"
@ arrow bans -> deadend "ban every exit →︎ a dead end" !dashed
@ arrow bans -> bansresult "measured"
@ arrow conflicts -> bansresult "explains the sign" !dotted
